  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/47670f2f21ffe847210deae570da72fcfe284773.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmmcreviews.com%252fall%252fmods%252fhibernal-herbs%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/mmcreviews_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"MCC Reviews\" width=\"65\" height=\"64\"></a> &nbsp; \n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fhibernal-herbs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"65\" height=\"64\"></a> &nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://github.com/DakotaPride/hibernal-herbs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"65\" height=\"64\"></a> &nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8NkWwu9hgN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"65\" height=\"64\"></a> &nbsp;\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.kinetichosting.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/57e54853825c80a1ccf03302564e00b3483d7e57.png\" alt=\"Kinetic Hosting\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodfest.net%252fvanity%252fbc25\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/worldwidepixel/badges/642d312b71811b9d2696b562f735b07288844c71/bc25/featured_in/cozy.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"217\" height=\"56\"></a>\n</p>\n<p>漫步在 snowy 生物群系中，你会遇到神秘的药草和迷幻树！这些是开始玩《冬眠草药》的关键。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ltpcgl8.png\" width=\"750\" height=\"auto\"></p>\n<p><br>从晾干药草到召唤新的金属，神秘篝火是推动模组进程的核心部件！香炉会根据你提供的捣碎或干燥药草，为你和周围的生物施加状态效果。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HmSbfyt.png\" width=\"750\" height=\"auto\"></p>\n<p><br>你还需要探索末地高地，才能到达远古遗迹。那里存放着关键物品，你很可能需要获取它们来解锁该模组中的真正潜力。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgRuYplct5xv-GTDt6-EvJjA4Sy4mnUC1jlyS0YIF7KZS3B3SBjIhOga0WJKaSYypFIVUfOOXXb8K0l3-nFt0OouElbAl0dsjAYeinnDPlRAvKQWMKXaVe5u0SrVHR7CL0M_VzK0T3ThZ-lBmDlAodV2V4Zb0r5eQ8QHGzjUm1OcH-qDWVq2INdV8wxUlhZ/s2058/2025-02-20_19.11.02.png\" width=\"750\" height=\"auto\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>可用版本</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>Minecraft 1.21.4 - 不可用</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Minecraft 1.21/1.21.1 - Fabric/Neoforge - 支持，v1.4 及以上版本</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Minecraft 1.20/1.20.1 - Fabric/Forge - 最高 v1.3.x</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Minecraft 1.19/1.19.1/1.19.2 - Fabric/Forge - 最高 v1.0.x</strong></p>\n<h2><strong>1.21+ 版本依赖</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>Fabric 下需要 <a href=\"modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Fabric 和 Neoforge 下均需要 <a href=\"modrinth.com/mod/patchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Fabric 和 Neoforge 下均需要 <a href=\"modrinth.com/mod/accessories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Accessories</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Fabric 和 Neoforge 下均需要 <a href=\"modrinth.com/mod/emi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>（可选）与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/catalogue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Catalogue</a> 兼容</strong></p>",
